"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunk_8x8_developer_docs=globalThis.webpackChunk_8x8_developer_docs||[]).push([[60027],{56113:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"id":"2026-10-13-whatsapp-direct-send","date":"2026-10-13","products":["Connect","APIs"],"product":"Connect","channel":"WhatsApp","changeType":"Added","title":"WhatsApp Direct Send","excerpt":"A new guide documents Direct Send: you send utility message content directly, and WhatsApp matches it to an existing template or creates one for you. You don\'t need to create a template or wait for approval before the first send.","hasArticle":true,"bodyHtml":"<p>A new guide documents <strong>Direct Send</strong>: you send utility message content directly, and WhatsApp matches it to an existing template or creates one for you. You don&#39;t need to create a template or wait for approval before the first send.</p>\\n<h2>How it works</h2>\\n<p>Add a <code>content.whatsApp.directSend</code> object to a request on the existing Send Message endpoint. There&#39;s no separate endpoint or setup call.</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"language-json\\">{\\n  &quot;user&quot;: { &quot;msisdn&quot;: &quot;+6500000000&quot; },\\n  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;text&quot;,\\n  &quot;channels&quot;: [{ &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;WhatsApp&quot; }],\\n  &quot;content&quot;: {\\n    &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Hi Jane, your order #12345 has been shipped and is expected to arrive on March 20.&quot;,\\n    &quot;whatsApp&quot;: {\\n      &quot;directSend&quot;: { &quot;category&quot;: &quot;utility&quot;, &quot;ttlSeconds&quot;: 600 }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Category:</strong> <code>utility</code> only. Messages are charged at utility rates. Send marketing and authentication messages as template messages.</li>\\n<li><strong>Message types:</strong> text, interactive CTA URL (one button), and interactive reply buttons (1 to 3). Interactive headers must be text.</li>\\n<li><strong>Time-to-live:</strong> optional <code>ttlSeconds</code>, from 30 to 43200 seconds. WhatsApp rejects a TTL on any message that isn&#39;t a Direct Send message.</li>\\n<li><strong>Recipient:</strong> by phone number (<code>msisdn</code>) or BSUID (<code>channelUserId</code>).</li>\\n<li><strong>Delivery receipts</strong> carry <code>whatsapp.templateId</code>, the template WhatsApp used for the message. Store it: it&#39;s the only link between a message and the template that carried it.</li>\\n<li><strong>Generated templates</strong> are named <code>auto_generated_\u2026</code>, and you can&#39;t edit or delete them. Templates that are created but never used are deleted after 24 hours.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The guide also covers template pauses (error <code>132015</code>), category misuse detection, account restrictions, message limits, and an integration checklist.</p>\\n<h2>Sample submission endpoint removed</h2>\\n<p>Direct Send doesn&#39;t need a sample submission step, so the <strong>Submit WhatsApp Direct Send Sample</strong> endpoint (<code>POST /api/v1/whatsapp/subaccounts/{subAccountId}/channels/{channelId}/directSend/sample</code>) has been removed from the API reference.</p>\\n<h2>Read more</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\"/connect/docs/whatsapp/whatsapp-direct-send\\">WhatsApp Direct Send API</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\"/connect/reference/send-message\\">Send Message API reference</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\"/connect/docs/delivery-receipts-for-outbound-chatapps\\">Delivery receipts for Outbound Messaging Apps</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n"}')}}]);